258
00:21:56.336 --> 00:21:58.710
We set up Section 20
for exactly this kind

259
00:21:58.711 --> 00:22:01.124
of politically delicate incident.

260
00:22:01.125 --> 00:22:02.452
Thanks. Hugh.

261
00:22:02.453 --> 00:22:04.626
Major Collinson heads up the unit.

262
00:22:04.627 --> 00:22:06.036
Sir Patrick.

263
00:22:06.037 --> 00:22:09.577
With Hugh's experience in the field
and specialist Arabic knowledge.

264
00:22:09.578 --> 00:22:12.031
he's uniquely placed
to resolve this situation.

265
00:22:12.032 --> 00:22:15.091
If you find Katie. what can you do?

266
00:22:15.092 --> 00:22:17.787
Section 20 works closely
with UK Special forces.

267
00:22:17.788 --> 00:22:20.804
Once we have a location.
we can start implementing a rescue.

268
00:22:20.805 --> 00:22:24.630
We've got a team on standby. They
can be in Iraq within eight hours.

269
00:22:26.965 --> 00:22:29.137
It's the last resort. sir.

270
00:22:31.150 --> 00:22:32.919
Would an offer of money help?

271
00:22:32.920 --> 00:22:35.416
Not until they make contact.
No. sir.

272
00:22:41.655 --> 00:22:44.793
But we do have a promising lead.

273
00:22:45.760 --> 00:22:48.575
A photograph your daughter took
of one of her abductors.

274
00:22:48.576 --> 00:22:49.944
Clever girl.

275
00:22:49.945 --> 00:22:53.244
So far. Iraqi intelligence
haven't been able to identify him.

276
00:22:53.245 --> 00:22:56.062
I suggest we let the networks
broadcast this image.

277
00:22:56.063 --> 00:22:58.396
Might throw up a local witness.
Offer a reward.

278
00:22:58.397 --> 00:23:01.094
I'm not sure that's the best -
Just do it.

279
00:23:02.865 --> 00:23:04.917
Of course. sir.

280
00:23:57.157 --> 00:23:58.967
"Hello?"

281
00:23:58.968 --> 00:24:01.181
It's me.

282
00:24:01.182 --> 00:24:04.442
"I promised I'd call. Is she there?"
Hold on. John.

283
00:24:05.488 --> 00:24:07.380
It's your dad.

284
00:24:08.588 --> 00:24:10.721
You hardly see him.

285
00:24:14.906 --> 00:24:16.917
Hello.
"How are you. Lexi?"

286
00:24:16.918 --> 00:24:18.286
It's Alex.

287
00:24:19.695 --> 00:24:22.351
Listen. I'm gonna change my shifts.

288
00:24:22.352 --> 00:24:24.485
See if I can come up next weekend.

289
00:24:24.486 --> 00:24:26.900
I'm kind of busy next weekend.

290
00:24:29.677 --> 00:24:31.688
Alright then. Well. another weekend.

291
00:24:31.689 --> 00:24:35.030
We can do something together.
just you and me -

292
00:24:37.927 --> 00:24:40.301
"..Mobile phone
photographed this image

293
00:24:40.302 --> 00:24:43.359
of a policeman approaching
what investigators believe to be

294
00:24:43.360 --> 00:24:45.130
"the vehicle she was in."

295
00:24:45.131 --> 00:24:48.752
"British intelligence authorities
have confirmed that this is likely"

296
00:24:48.753 --> 00:24:50.605
to be the face
of one of her abductors.

297
00:24:50.606 --> 00:24:53.462
"disguised in an Iraqi
police uniform."

298
00:24:53.463 --> 00:24:56.118
"British security forces
believe this photograph."

299
00:24:56.119 --> 00:24:58.171
taken on Miss Dartmouth's
mobile phone.

300
00:24:58.172 --> 00:25:00.063
"could be one of her abductors."

301
00:25:00.064 --> 00:25:03.201
"It's thought that Katie herself
must have managed to forward

302
00:25:03.202 --> 00:25:06.300
the image to her London office
at the time of the abduction."

303
00:25:06.301 --> 00:25:09.680
Police and intelligence authorities
are asking anyone who thinks

304
00:25:09.681 --> 00:25:15.194
"they might have information
to contact the relevant services."

305
00:25:39.947 --> 00:25:41.475
Salam.

306
00:25:47.622 --> 00:25:51.196
I hope you are here
for only a short time.

307
00:25:51.197 --> 00:25:53.688
And then you will go home.

308
00:25:56.982 --> 00:25:58.708
May I have some water. please?

309
00:25:58.709 --> 00:26:01.601
Of course. You are our guest.

310
00:26:04.133 --> 00:26:06.062
After we have quenched your thirst.

311
00:26:06.063 --> 00:26:08.390
there is something
you must do for us.

312
00:26:08.391 --> 00:26:10.239
Sir. we've just picked up
a Webcast.

313
00:26:10.240 --> 00:26:12.409
It was uploaded
less than ten minutes ago.

314
00:26:12.410 --> 00:26:14.658
Put it up on the big screen.

315
00:26:26.630 --> 00:26:31.128
"We demand the release of our
brother. Mohammed Jassim Ali."

316
00:26:31.129 --> 00:26:34.544
"Unless this holy warrior
is freed..."

317
00:26:34.545 --> 00:26:37.155
..the hostage will be executed...

318
00:26:37.156 --> 00:26:40.529
..at one minute after midnight
on Jumu'ah." That's their Sabbath.

319
00:26:40.530 --> 00:26:43.422
Rewind the tape. Get me a profile
on Mohammed Jassim Ali.

320
00:26:43.423 --> 00:26:45.270
Stop. Check the date on the paper.

321
00:26:45.271 --> 00:26:48.765
Mohammed Jassim Ali is currently
being held in Bellmarsh Prison

322
00:26:48.766 --> 00:26:50.213
under anti-terrorism laws.

323
00:26:50.214 --> 00:26:52.541
They're calling themselves
"Sword of Islam."

324
00:26:52.542 --> 00:26:55.072
What do we know about them?
I'll get a full history.

325
00:26:55.073 --> 00:26:58.086
Trace that IP address.
find out where they're sending from.

326
00:26:58.087 --> 00:26:59.893
Already tracing. sir.

327
00:26:59.894 --> 00:27:02.184
We've got until midnight Friday.

328
00:27:02.185 --> 00:27:03.791
Seven days.

329
00:27:03.916 --> 00:27:07.340
I don't care who you say you are.
you're not coming beyond this point.

330
00:27:07.341 --> 00:27:08.588
Layla. please.

331
00:27:08.589 --> 00:27:10.765
I'm sorry. sir.
The security guard thinks-

332
00:27:10.766 --> 00:27:13.988
It's OK. we're old comrades. John.

333
00:27:13.989 --> 00:27:15.197
Please.

334
00:27:17.212 --> 00:27:19.268
It's just here.

335
00:27:25.230 --> 00:27:28.050
It's him. isn't it?

336
00:27:28.051 --> 00:27:30.347
It looks like him. I grant you.

337
00:27:30.348 --> 00:27:32.240
Come on. the age fits.

338
00:27:32.241 --> 00:27:34.335
He'd be 17/18 by now.
living in that area.

339
00:27:34.336 --> 00:27:36.753
Can't be ten miles
from the Bratton location.

340
00:27:36.754 --> 00:27:39.855
There's been years of war.
thousands of young men have scars.

341
00:27:39.856 --> 00:27:42.112
He is proof of a connection.
With what?

342
00:27:42.113 --> 00:27:44.852
Between Katie's kidnapping
and Bratton's.

343
00:27:44.853 --> 00:27:47.188
Alright. look.

344
00:27:47.189 --> 00:27:50.252
Remember him?
Colonel Hakim Al Naziri.

345
00:27:50.253 --> 00:27:52.829
Former head of security
in Saddam's secret police.

346
00:27:52.830 --> 00:27:55.006
I saw him that night
commanding the attack.

347
00:27:55.007 --> 00:27:58.632
You saw him. John. No-one else.
He was there.

348
00:27:59.761 --> 00:28:02.380
Naziri was never picked up
after the invasion.

349
00:28:02.381 --> 00:28:03.707
Look.

350
00:28:03.708 --> 00:28:07.336
He's suspected of masterminding a
series of attacks on British forces.

351
00:28:07.337 --> 00:28:09.873
Not to mention financing
Baathist Sunni groups.

352
00:28:09.874 --> 00:28:12.250
including the one
this man belongs to.

353
00:28:12.251 --> 00:28:15.435
The man these people are demanding
is released from Bellmarsh.

354
00:28:15.436 --> 00:28:17.609
Where are you going with all this?

355
00:28:17.610 --> 00:28:20.551
If Naziri is Sword of Islam.

356
00:28:20.552 --> 00:28:23.693
they might still be using
the original safe house in Basra.

357
00:28:23.694 --> 00:28:25.788
It's been seven years. John.

358
00:28:25.789 --> 00:28:28.247
Just get me to the safe house.

359
00:28:28.248 --> 00:28:31.308
I can infiltrate the group.

360
00:28:31.309 --> 00:28:33.284
Maybe even get to Scarface.
John...

361
00:28:33.285 --> 00:28:34.614
Look!

362
00:28:39.488 --> 00:28:43.076
Just... let me find him.

363
00:28:45.250 --> 00:28:47.305
Let me find him.

364
00:28:48.797 --> 00:28:51.577
And then you can send in the lads.

365
00:28:55.889 --> 00:28:59.353
You remember what he said to me
that night. don't you?

366
00:29:02.416 --> 00:29:05.921
I lay my life for your sake.

367
00:29:07.209 --> 00:29:09.748
He owes me.

368
00:29:09.749 --> 00:29:12.931
No matter what he did
to Mike and Keith and Steve.

369
00:29:12.932 --> 00:29:16.881
he owes ME a debt of honour.

370
00:29:19.903 --> 00:29:22.803
John. you can't...

371
00:29:22.804 --> 00:29:26.348
..seriously expect me to entertain
this half-baked notion

372
00:29:26.349 --> 00:29:30.258
to satisfy your need for -
I'm not talking about revenge.

373
00:29:31.265 --> 00:29:34.408
I was going to say atonement.

374
00:29:40.169 --> 00:29:42.990
This won't bring them back. John.

375
00:29:44.924 --> 00:29:48.308
But it could get you killed.

376
00:29:48.309 --> 00:29:50.806
Or is that exactly what you want?

377
00:30:34.935 --> 00:30:37.394
Why are you doing this to me?

378
00:30:39.170 --> 00:30:41.550
You are your father's daughter.

379
00:30:49.740 --> 00:30:52.442
He isn't even a minister any more.

380
00:30:58.656 --> 00:31:02.084
200.000 Iraqis died
since the invasion.

381
00:31:02.085 --> 00:31:04.624
And I've always reported the truth.

382
00:31:04.625 --> 00:31:06.320
Always.
Yes.

383
00:31:08.860 --> 00:31:14.307
But your father helped spread
British and American lies.

384
00:31:59.943 --> 00:32:02.527
Sword of Islam
is a Sunni militant group

385
00:32:02.528 --> 00:32:05.598
responsible for a string of bombings
in the Basra area.

386
00:32:05.599 --> 00:32:07.941
Given what we know
about their modus operandi.

387
00:32:07.942 --> 00:32:10.648
the time of the Webcast
and the location of the kidnap.

388
00:32:10.649 --> 00:32:12.666
we believe Katie is being held

389
00:32:12.667 --> 00:32:16.748
somewhere within
this region in southern Iraq.

390
00:32:16.749 --> 00:32:19.009
This must be an area
the size of Wales.

391
00:32:19.010 --> 00:32:21.918
We're trying to pinpoint her
or at least narrow the window

392
00:32:21.919 --> 00:32:24.019
by locating the IP address
of the Webcast.

393
00:32:24.020 --> 00:32:25.878
Shouldn't we have that traced by now?

394
00:32:25.879 --> 00:32:28.745
Yes. but the Webcast was routed
by dozens of servers.

395
00:32:28.746 --> 00:32:31.169
Unfortunately because
we only have one upload.

396
00:32:31.170 --> 00:32:33.229
we can't analyse the back scatter.

397
00:32:33.230 --> 00:32:36.261
So they've been clever?
Very.

398
00:32:36.262 --> 00:32:38.281
Anything else?

399
00:32:41.392 --> 00:32:43.894
Anything at all?

400
00:32:43.895 --> 00:32:46.157
There is one possibility.

401
00:32:46.158 --> 00:32:47.733
Go on.

402
00:32:47.734 --> 00:32:51.045
A former special forces operative
believes there's a connection

403
00:32:51.046 --> 00:32:55.288
between the man Katie Dartmouth
photographed during her abduction

404
00:32:55.289 --> 00:32:58.278
and the Bratton extraction in 2003.

405
00:32:58.279 --> 00:33:01.388
He thinks he may be able
to utilise Scarface as an asset.

406
00:33:01.389 --> 00:33:04.294
but it's a very long shot.

407
00:33:04.295 --> 00:33:09.144
Well. long-shot or not. use him.

408
00:33:09.145 --> 00:33:10.559
Thank you.

409
00:33:14.800 --> 00:33:16.415
Morning. Peter.
Morning. sir.

410
00:33:16.416 --> 00:33:20.051
You didn't think it worth mentioning
that Porter's been off active duty

411
00:33:20.052 --> 00:33:23.445
for eight years. has borderline
post-traumatic stress disorder.

412
00:33:23.446 --> 00:33:25.342
a ten percent weakness in one arm.

413
00:33:25.343 --> 00:33:28.414
and what effectively amounts
to a dishonourable discharge.

414
00:33:28.415 --> 00:33:30.637
Layla. we have nothing.

415
00:33:31.808 --> 00:33:34.797
Tell Porter he's been reactivated.

416
00:34:10.197 --> 00:34:13.962
Have a look at the cards
and tell me what they remind you of.

417
00:34:13.963 --> 00:34:15.286
A vagina.

418
00:34:27.065 --> 00:34:28.746
A vagina.

419
00:34:34.235 --> 00:34:35.517
Er...

420
00:34:37.439 --> 00:34:38.962
A vagina.

421
00:34:50.539 --> 00:34:52.743
I'll work harder.
I'm not going to blow this.

422
00:34:52.744 --> 00:34:54.466
Chances are this is all academic.

423
00:34:54.467 --> 00:34:57.270
Katie's dad has kicked up
enough of a fuss in Westminster

424
00:34:57.271 --> 00:35:00.434
for the Prime Minister
to authorise an offer via the Swiss.

425
00:35:00.435 --> 00:35:03.118
They have a go-between apparently.

426
00:35:03.119 --> 00:35:05.681
A ransom?
Yeah.

427
00:35:05.682 --> 00:35:07.365
It's all deniable. of course.

428
00:35:07.366 --> 00:35:09.728
But Katie goes free
and Ali stays inside.

429
00:35:09.729 --> 00:35:12.692
Hakim is not just some insurgent.
He's a strategist.

430
00:35:12.693 --> 00:35:15.696
Hakim Al Naziri. Your pet theory.

431
00:35:15.697 --> 00:35:17.979
For which there's absolutely
zero evidence.

432
00:35:17.980 --> 00:35:21.306
But if I'm right.
and Hakim has joined the zealots.

433
00:35:21.307 --> 00:35:23.150
that ransom could be a provocation.

434
00:35:23.151 --> 00:35:26.555
Thank you. Porter.
I'll put that in a memo.

435
00:35:31.162 --> 00:35:33.565
How are you feeling this evening.
Sergeant?

436
00:35:33.566 --> 00:35:35.888
Absolutely bloody knackered.
Sergeant.

437
00:35:35.888 --> 00:35:40.976
Well. getting a body into shape in
a matter of days... it's gonna hurt.

438
00:35:40.977 --> 00:35:44.341
Are you saying I'm not in shape?
No. no. I'm...

439
00:35:47.426 --> 00:35:50.391
Erm. how is your tooth?
Sore.

440
00:35:50.392 --> 00:35:53.716
I know. The tracker is like having
a very uncomfortable filling.

441
00:35:53.717 --> 00:35:56.239
But we need to know where you are
at all times.

442
00:35:56.239 --> 00:35:59.245
You could have just asked
for my mobile number.

443
00:36:02.850 --> 00:36:05.414
Here's something for the pain.

444
00:36:07.578 --> 00:36:11.143
There's a good boy.
Oh. I'm a very good boy.

445
00:36:14.549 --> 00:36:19.636
Well. then I think...
you probably...

446
00:36:21.399 --> 00:36:23.963
..deserve a bit of a treat.
don't you?

447
00:36:41.309 --> 00:36:43.952
If only there was another way.

448
00:36:43.953 --> 00:36:45.875
Forgive me.

449
00:36:45.876 --> 00:36:48.721
No. No. No!

450
00:36:48.722 --> 00:36:50.281
No! No!

451
00:36:50.282 --> 00:36:53.847
Sir. they are responding
to the ransom offer.

452
00:36:58.095 --> 00:37:00.016
Oh fuck.

453
00:37:00.017 --> 00:37:01.500
No. No.

454
00:37:04.705 --> 00:37:08.229
"The British do not believe
we are committed to our cause."

455
00:37:08.230 --> 00:37:12.196
"They think we crave...
their blood money."

456
00:37:13.718 --> 00:37:15.602
No! No!

457
00:37:19.206 --> 00:37:21.091
Jesus Christ.

458
00:37:33.789 --> 00:37:35.151
Yes?

459
00:37:37.075 --> 00:37:38.716
I'll tell him right away.

460
00:37:38.717 --> 00:37:40.561
They fucked up.
it was a live Webcast.

461
00:37:40.562 --> 00:37:43.363
So we can track their IP address?
Pinpoint the location?

462
00:37:43.364 --> 00:37:45.807
Yes. 24 hours max.
Get yourself back to Hereford.

463
00:37:45.808 --> 00:37:48.250
I want the team airborne to Basra
and ready to move

464
00:37:48.251 --> 00:37:50.174
the moment we get a location.
I'm on it.

465
00:37:50.175 --> 00:37:52.579
Priority task.
Standby for IP address.

466
00:37:52.580 --> 00:37:54.380
We've got the bastards.

467
00:37:54.381 --> 00:37:56.623
We'll take a C-130
to Basra Air Station.

468
00:37:56.624 --> 00:37:59.346
Ferguson's group
will be designated Alpha Team.

469
00:37:59.347 --> 00:38:01.990
We'll be deployed in a standby
at the US base in Basra.

470
00:38:01.991 --> 00:38:03.835
to be used only in the event
of contact

471
00:38:03.836 --> 00:38:05.638
between Alpha Team and Scarface.

472
00:38:05.639 --> 00:38:07.439
So. I get to be B Team.

473
00:38:07.440 --> 00:38:09.964
I think you're lucky to be
that far up the alphabet.

474
00:38:09.965 --> 00:38:12.128
I'd settle for an R
and you can call me Romeo.

475
00:38:12.129 --> 00:38:15.613
Oh yes. the nurse. Danni is
a special operative for Section 20.

476
00:38:15.614 --> 00:38:18.978
Her remit includes honey traps and
so forth. She was assigned to you

477
00:38:18.979 --> 00:38:22.826
after the psychologist diagnosed
mission limiting self-esteem issues.

478
00:38:22.827 --> 00:38:27.430
Compounded by a fixation
on physical and sexual inadequacy.

479
00:38:27.431 --> 00:38:30.395
In layman's team. you needed a shag.

480
00:38:30.396 --> 00:38:32.601
You're driving.

481
00:38:47.183 --> 00:38:48.665
Hello. lads.

482
00:38:48.666 --> 00:38:51.107
..Location is 35 clicks
around Basra.

483
00:38:51.108 --> 00:38:54.874
possibly up to the north-west.
Then once we've...

484
00:38:56.396 --> 00:38:58.158
Do you need something. Porter?

485
00:38:58.159 --> 00:39:01.043
No. No. I was just wondering
if you might need my services.

486
00:39:01.044 --> 00:39:04.649
We're kind of having a private
operational discussion here. pal.

487
00:39:08.214 --> 00:39:09.937
Sorry. mate.

488
00:39:12.541 --> 00:39:15.226
Listen. I need a favour
from someone in the motor pool.

489
00:39:15.227 --> 00:39:17.988
Anybody got any connections?
Yeah. this way.

490
00:39:17.989 --> 00:39:19.432
Thanks.

491
00:39:24.000 --> 00:39:26.200
Sir. we have a location. Al Khalifa.

492
00:39:26.201 --> 00:39:28.045
Put it on the screen. Sergeant.

493
00:39:28.046 --> 00:39:30.768
Coordinates 30 degrees.
50 minutes. .50 north.

494
00:39:30.769 --> 00:39:34.332
47 degrees. 31 minutes. .46 east.

495
00:39:34.333 --> 00:39:37.299
Call Layla. Prepare Alpha Team.

496
00:39:42.868 --> 00:39:46.674
See you later. They found her.
35 clicks from Basra.

497
00:40:21.207 --> 00:40:24.530
"This is 2-8 Alpha.
Crossing now. over."

498
00:40:24.531 --> 00:40:26.413
Time to target. 17 seconds.

499
00:40:26.414 --> 00:40:29.378
> Confirm.
Final line crossed at 19-17.

500
00:40:31.862 --> 00:40:35.148
"We are on the start line.
Good to go at your command."

501
00:40:35.149 --> 00:40:38.272
They are in position. sir.
It's your call.

502
00:40:42.400 --> 00:40:45.165
I've done a terrible thing to you.

503
00:40:47.366 --> 00:40:51.493
But consider the blood of ours
that has been spilt.

504
00:40:53.455 --> 00:40:56.220
Is it worth less than yours?

505
00:40:58.625 --> 00:41:00.707
"We're good to go. sir."

506
00:41:00.708 --> 00:41:02.269
Let's do it.

507
00:41:03.911 --> 00:41:06.354
Go. go. go.
"Roger that. moving now."

508
00:41:06.355 --> 00:41:10.081
"Found target. 2-8 Alfa landing now."

509
00:41:13.046 --> 00:41:15.007
Go. go. go.

510
00:41:15.008 --> 00:41:17.652
Get out! Troops disembarking.

511
00:41:37.203 --> 00:41:39.246
Keep it tight. guys.

512
00:41:43.854 --> 00:41:46.417
"Alpha Team entering building now."

513
00:41:49.542 --> 00:41:55.391
We will change your dressing.
We will treat you with respect.

514
00:41:55.392 --> 00:41:59.317
But if your government
does not set our brother free.

515
00:41:59.318 --> 00:42:01.480
we will kill you.

516
00:42:16.784 --> 00:42:19.108
Steady. lads. Steady.

517
00:42:21.271 --> 00:42:22.953
There's a door ahead.

518
00:42:27.401 --> 00:42:29.482
"Approaching door now."

519
00:42:33.208 --> 00:42:35.091
"OK. blow it."

520
00:42:41.061 --> 00:42:42.301
Go. go. go!

521
00:42:42.302 --> 00:42:46.268
"There's someone here."
"Katie? Miss Dartmouth?"

522
00:42:46.269 --> 00:42:47.351
Katie?

523
00:42:48.792 --> 00:42:51.035
Shit.

524
00:42:54.722 --> 00:42:56.724
> Repeat. lost comms. sir.

525
00:42:56.725 --> 00:42:59.167
Alpha Team. come in.
Layla. we just lost signal.

526
00:42:59.168 --> 00:43:02.253
> Alpha Team. please respond.
Layla. what just happened?

527
00:43:02.254 --> 00:43:05.056
Alpha Team. this is section 20.
Lieutenant. report!

528
00:43:05.057 --> 00:43:07.140
Oh my God. Fergie!

529
00:43:07.141 --> 00:43:10.265
"The entire building
has just gone up. sir."

530
00:43:10.266 --> 00:43:12.067
"I can't see them."

531
00:43:12.068 --> 00:43:14.432
"I can't see Alpha Team."

532
00:43:48.605 --> 00:43:52.369
"John. where are you going
with all this?"

533
00:43:52.370 --> 00:43:55.412
If Naziri is Sword of Islam.

534
00:43:55.413 --> 00:43:59.499
they might still be using
the original safe house in Basra.

535
00:43:59.500 --> 00:44:02.345
"Just get me to the safe house."

536
00:44:02.346 --> 00:44:05.269
"I can infiltrate the group."

537
00:44:05.269 --> 00:44:07.755
"Maybe even get to Scarface."

538
00:44:08.305 --> 00:45:08.431
